{
  "name": "SSL Certificate Expiry Checker",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "domains",
              "value": "example.com,api.example.com,app.example.com,admin.example.com"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Set Domain List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const domains = $input.first().json.domains.split(',').map(d => d.trim());\nreturn domains.map(domain => ({ json: { domain } }));"
      },
      "name": "Split Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://ssl-checker.io/api/v1/check/{{ $json.domain }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check SSL Certificate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [920, 300],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst now = new Date();\nconst expiry = new Date(item.result?.valid_till || item.valid_till || now);\nconst daysUntilExpiry = Math.ceil((expiry - now) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\nconst domain = item.domain || item.host || 'unknown';\n\nlet alertLevel = 'OK';\nif (daysUntilExpiry <= 7) alertLevel = 'CRITICAL';\nelse if (daysUntilExpiry <= 14) alertLevel = 'WARNING';\nelse if (daysUntilExpiry <= 30) alertLevel = 'NOTICE';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    domain,\n    expiryDate: expiry.toISOString().split('T')[0],\n    daysUntilExpiry,\n    alertLevel,\n    issuer: item.result?.issuer || item.issuer || 'N/A',\n    timestamp: now.toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Calculate Days Until Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1140, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-expiring",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.daysUntilExpiry }}",
              "rightValue": 30,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "smallerEqual"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "name": "Expiring Soon?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1360, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "🔐 *SSL Certificate Expiry Alert*\n\nDomain: `{{ $json.domain }}`\nExpiry Date: {{ $json.expiryDate }}\nDays Remaining: {{ $json.daysUntilExpiry }}\nAlert Level: {{ $json.alertLevel }}\nIssuer: {{ $json.issuer }}\n\n{{ $json.alertLevel === 'CRITICAL' ? '🔴 RENEW IMMEDIATELY!' : $json.alertLevel === 'WARNING' ? '🟡 Renew soon!' : '🟠 Plan renewal.' }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "name": "Telegram Expiry Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1580, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "",
        "subject": "=SSL Certificate Expiry {{ $json.alertLevel }}: {{ $json.domain }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=SSL Certificate for {{ $json.domain }} expires on {{ $json.expiryDate }} ({{ $json.daysUntilExpiry }} days remaining).\n\nAlert Level: {{ $json.alertLevel }}\nIssuer: {{ $json.issuer }}\n\nPlease renew the certificate before it expires."
      },
      "name": "Email Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1580, 360],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "byName",
          "value": "SSLTracking"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "timestamp": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
            "domain": "={{ $json.domain }}",
            "expiry_date": "={{ $json.expiryDate }}",
            "days_remaining": "={{ $json.daysUntilExpiry }}",
            "alert_level": "={{ $json.alertLevel }}",
            "issuer": "={{ $json.issuer }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets SSL Tracking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1580, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SSL Certificate Expiry Checker\n\n**Schedule:** Daily at 8:00 AM\n**Function:** Checks SSL certificate expiry for list of domains.\n\n**Alert Levels:**\n- 🟠 NOTICE: ≤30 days\n- 🟡 WARNING: ≤14 days\n- 🔴 CRITICAL: ≤7 days\n\n**Notifications:** Telegram + Email for expiring certs.\n**Tracking:** All results logged to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup\n1. Update domain list in 'Set Domain List'\n2. Configure Telegram and SMTP credentials\n3. Set Google Sheets document ID",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, -80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Domain List",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Domain List": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Domains",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Domains": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check SSL Certificate",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check SSL Certificate": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Calculate Days Until Expiry",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Calculate Days Until Expiry": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Expiring Soon?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Expiring Soon?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Telegram Expiry Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Email Notification",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Google Sheets SSL Tracking",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}